---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return [{ params: { lang: 'en' } }, { params: { lang: 'zh' } }];
}

const lang = Astro.params.lang === 'zh' ? 'zh' : 'en';
const zh = lang === 'zh';
const translations = { en: '/en/supply/', zh: '/zh/supply/' };
const email = 'xden2019@gmail.com';
const subject = zh ? '电子纸选型咨询' : 'E-paper panel enquiry';

const families = zh
  ? [
      { name: '黑白', sizes: '0.97 – 13.3 寸', colours: '黑、白', use: '价签、阅读器、仪表' },
      { name: 'BWR / BWRY(E5)', sizes: '1.54 – 17.06 寸', colours: '黑、白、红、黄', use: '价签、胸牌、桌牌' },
      { name: 'E6(Spectra 6)', sizes: '1.18 – 31.5 寸', colours: '黑白黄红蓝绿', use: '标牌、相框、胸章' }
    ]
  : [
      { name: 'Monochrome', sizes: '0.97 – 13.3 in', colours: 'black, white', use: 'labels, readers, instruments' },
      { name: 'BWR / BWRY (E5)', sizes: '1.54 – 17.06 in', colours: 'black, white, red, yellow', use: 'tags, badges, desk cards' },
      { name: 'E6 (Spectra 6)', sizes: '1.18 – 31.5 in', colours: 'black, white, yellow, red, blue, green', use: 'signage, frames, badges' }
    ];
---

<Base
  lang={lang}
  title={zh ? '电子纸面板、驱动板与整机方案' : 'E-paper panels, driver boards and finished displays'}
  description={zh
    ? '电子纸面板与模组供货：黑白、BWRY、E6 六色，0.97 至 31.5 寸，配套驱动板、定制排线与固件调试。'
    : 'E-paper panels and modules: monochrome, BWRY and E6 six-colour from 0.97 to 31.5 inch, with driver boards, custom FPC and firmware bring-up.'}
  translations={translations}
>
  <section class="en-supply">
    <p class="eyebrow">EMBEDDEDNOTE · {zh ? '供货与方案' : 'SUPPLY'}</p>
    <h1>{zh ? '电子纸面板、驱动板与整机方案' : 'E-paper panels, driver boards and finished displays'}</h1>
    <p class="en-supply-lede">
      {zh
        ? '这个站点的技术文章写的正是我们供货的这类屏。如果你正在选型、要样品、或者需要一块能直接点亮的驱动板，从这里开始。'
        : 'We supply the kind of panels this site writes about. If you are specifying an e-paper display and need samples, a driver board, or a custom FPC, start here.'}
    </p>

    <div class="supply-cards">
      <article>
        <h2>{zh ? '面板与模组' : 'Panels and modules'}</h2>
        <p>
          {zh
            ? '黑白、四色(BWR / BWRY)、六色(E6)。带 FPC 的裸屏模组,SPI 接口为主,大尺寸有并口方案。'
            : 'Monochrome, four-colour (BWR / BWRY) and six-colour (E6). Bare modules with FPC, mostly SPI, with parallel options on the larger sizes.'}
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>{zh ? '驱动板' : 'Driver boards'}</h2>
        <p>
          {zh
            ? '把屏点亮所需的那一圈电路:升压、电平转换、SPI 接口,以及 ESP32 / STM32 / nRF 上的点亮固件。'
            : 'The circuit between a panel and your MCU: boost rails, level shifting, SPI, plus bring-up firmware for ESP32, STM32 and nRF parts.'}
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>{zh ? '集成支持' : 'Integration support'}</h2>
        <p>
          {zh
            ? '定制排线、结构图、刷新型号选择,以及"这张图在你的屏上为什么发灰"这类问题的排查。'
            : 'Custom FPC, mechanical drawings, waveform selection, and the debugging that starts with "why does this image look washed out on my panel".'
          }
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h2>{zh ? '供哪些屏' : 'What we stock and what we source'}</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap-supply">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>{zh ? '系列' : 'Family'}</th>
            <th>{zh ? '尺寸范围' : 'Size range'}</th>
            <th>{zh ? '颜色' : 'Colours'}</th>
            <th>{zh ? '常见用途' : 'Typical use'}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {families.map((f) => (
            <tr>
              <td>{f.name}</td>
              <td>{f.sizes}</td>
              <td>{f.colours}</td>
              <td>{f.use}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="supply-note">
      {zh
        ? '尺寸范围写的是我们实际走通过的型号;同一尺寸下往往有多个分辨率,选型请以具体型号为准。站内的 E6 家族表列了 15 个尺寸的分辨率与字节数。'
        : 'The ranges are parts we have actually handled. One diagonal usually carries several resolutions, so selection comes down to the exact model; the E6 table on this site lists 15 sizes with resolution and byte count.'}
    </p>

    <h2>{zh ? '怎么开始' : 'How it works'}</h2>
    <ol class="supply-steps">
      <li>
        <strong>{zh ? '说清楚需求' : 'Tell us the spec'}</strong>
        <span>{zh ? '尺寸、分辨率、颜色、接口、目标产量、认证要求。' : 'Size, resolution, colours, interface, target volume, certification.'}</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>{zh ? '样品' : 'Sample'}</strong>
        <span>{zh ? '先给一块能点亮的样品和对应数据手册。样品按成本收费,你自己验波形和显示效果。' : 'A working sample and its datasheet, so you can check the waveform and the image yourself. Samples are charged at cost.'}</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>{zh ? '验证' : 'Validation'}</strong>
        <span>{zh ? '温度、刷新策略、贴合与结构。这一步最容易发现问题,也最省钱。' : 'Temperature, refresh policy, bonding and mechanics. Problems found here are the cheap ones.'}</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>{zh ? '量产' : 'Volume'}</strong>
        <span>{zh ? '确认型号后进批量。MOQ 按型号定,交期连同是否定制排线一起报。' : 'Once the part is fixed, MOQ depends on the model; lead time comes with it, and a custom FPC moves both.'}</span>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>{zh ? '发邮件时请带上' : 'What to put in the email'}</h2>
    <ul class="supply-list">
      <li>{zh ? '目标尺寸与分辨率(或已知型号)' : 'Target size and resolution, or a part number you already use'}</li>
      <li>{zh ? '颜色数,以及是否需要局刷' : 'Colour count, and whether you need partial refresh'}</li>
      <li>{zh ? '主控与接口(SPI / 并口 / 其他)' : 'Host MCU and interface (SPI, parallel, other)'}</li>
      <li>{zh ? '预期年用量与首批数量' : 'Expected annual volume and first order'}</li>
      <li>{zh ? '销售地区与认证要求' : 'Destination market and certification needs'}</li>
      <li>{zh ? '时间节点:打样、试产、量产' : 'Timeline: prototype, pilot, mass production'}</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>{zh ? '两件我们不做的事' : 'Two things we do not do'}</h2>
    <p>
      {zh
        ? '第一,不编数据。给不出的参数,我们说给不出,不拿别家型号的数字顶上。第二,不写软文。这个站点的文章是编辑内容,供应商付费不会改变结论——包括我们自己供货的型号。'
        : 'We do not invent numbers: if a figure is not available, we say so instead of borrowing one from a similar part. And we do not sell reviews: the articles here stay editorial, and paying us does not change a conclusion, including about parts we supply.'}
    </p>


    <h2>{zh ? '三个常问的' : 'Three questions that come first'}</h2>
    <dl class="supply-faq">
      <dt>{zh ? '样品收费吗?' : 'Do samples cost anything?'}</dt>
      <dd>{zh
        ? '收成本费。样品给的是能点亮、带数据手册的实物,你可以先验波形和显示效果再决定。'
        : 'Yes, at cost. A sample ships as a working module with its datasheet, so you can check the waveform and the image before committing.'}</dd>
      <dt>{zh ? 'MOQ 是多少?' : 'What is the MOQ?'}</dt>
      <dd>{zh
        ? '按型号定。同一尺寸换个分辨率或颜色数,起订量就不一样,所以在报价里一起给,不单独挂一个笼统数字。'
        : 'It depends on the model. The same diagonal with a different resolution or colour set carries a different minimum, so it comes with the quote rather than as one blanket number.'}</dd>
      <dt>{zh ? '交期多久?' : 'How long is lead time?'}</dt>
      <dd>{zh
        ? '常备型号和定制排线差得比较多,按你确认的具体型号报。急的项目请在邮件里写明时间节点。'
        : 'Stock parts and custom FPC builds differ enough that we quote per confirmed part. If the timeline is tight, say so in the email.'}</dd>
    </dl>

    <div class="supply-contact">
      <p>
        {zh
          ? '把上面的信息发到这个邮箱,标题用「电子纸选型」;我们会在一个工作日内回,先回答能不能做,再谈价格。'
          : 'Send the list above to this address with "E-paper panel enquiry" in the subject. We reply within one working day, first on whether it is feasible, then on price.'}
      </p>
      <p class="supply-email">
        <a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}`}>{email}</a>
      </p>
      <p class="supply-company">
        {zh ? '供货方:Datadelta' : 'Supplied by Datadelta'}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .en-supply {
    width: min(100%, 820px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(38px, 6vw, 72px) 0 clamp(64px, 8vw, 110px);
  }
  .en-supply h1 {
    font: 700 clamp(34px, 4.2vw, 52px)/1.14 Georgia, 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    margin: 12px 0 22px;
    color: #17211e;
  }
  .en-supply h2 {
    font: 700 clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 26px)/1.3 Georgia, 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
    margin: 42px 0 14px;
    color: #17211e;
  }
  .en-supply-lede {
    color: #4d574f;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
  }
  .supply-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 26px 0 8px;
  }
  .supply-cards article {
    border: 1px solid #d8d0c3;
    background: #fbf8f2;
    padding: 18px 18px 16px;
  }
  .supply-cards h2 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .supply-cards p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #4d574f;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .table-wrap-supply {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid #e3dccf;
    background: #fffdf9;
  }
  .table-wrap-supply table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 520px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .table-wrap-supply th {
    background: #f4eee3;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #d6cdbd;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .table-wrap-supply td {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ece5d8;
  }
  .table-wrap-supply tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  .supply-note {
    color: #6a736c;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
  }
  .supply-steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    counter-reset: step;
  }
  .supply-steps li {
    counter-increment: step;
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 0 18px 46px;
    border-left: 1px solid #ddd5c7;
    margin-left: 15px;
  }
  .supply-steps li:last-child { border-left-color: transparent; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .supply-steps li::before {
    content: counter(step);
    position: absolute;
    left: -15px;
    top: -2px;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: #b94530;
    color: #fff;
    font: 700 13px system-ui, sans-serif;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .supply-steps strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; color: #17211e; }
  .supply-steps span { color: #4d574f; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .supply-list { margin: 14px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #37413b; line-height: 1.85; }
  .supply-faq {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
  }
  .supply-faq dt {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #17211e;
    margin: 14px 0 4px;
  }
  .supply-faq dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: #4d574f;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }
  .supply-contact {
    margin-top: 46px;
    border-top: 1px solid #d0c8bb;
    padding-top: 24px;
  }
  .supply-contact p { color: #4d574f; line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .supply-email { font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px); }
  .supply-email a { color: #b94530; text-underline-offset: 3px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .supply-email a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .supply-company { font-size: 13.5px; color: #6a736c; }
</style>
